and optimizations.

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:01.330
AlloyDB features
autopilot systems

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:04.900
to help both automatically
manage and dynamically adapt

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:08.200
the database systems to the
needs of the customer workload

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.430
they're running.

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:11.920
You no longer need to worry
about complex database

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:15.010
management tasks, such
as memory management,

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:17.560
vacuuming, and data tiering.

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:20.680
AlloyDB automatically
addresses them for you.

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:27.880
AlloyDB seamlessly integrates
with Google's portfolio

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:30.280
of distinctive AI
and ML services.

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:33.880
For example, Vertex AI
will be available at launch

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:36.960
for easy inferencing
with AlloyDB databases.

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:43.230
We're also making it easy to
build machine learning directly

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:46.140
into your applications with
intelligent transactions.

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:50.100
AlloyDB is preintegrated with
Vertex AI, Google Cloud's

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:52.500
